{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐盟委員會主席馮德萊恩周五（16日）表示，歐委會將提議進一步限制中國進口產品，將超越歐盟早前與北京達成的措施（即把中國混能車進口量減半）。</p><p>【相關報道：中歐混能車貿易達諒解 華出口或「減一半以上」】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:21.456907+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T04:07:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T09:37:34.852786+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:37:36.169952+00:00","content_hash":"64439aafca1840acd29d16ccdbfb55f997192c5eb945a16b92efbdf9ac417454","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}